      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Although the foundation of the specialty of anesthesiology is the treatment of pain, most CRNA practitioners are more focused on and competent in the maintenance of physiological dynamics than in the evaluation and treatment of pain. A lexicon and an established model based on the integration of pathology and pain behavior are discussed, and their mutual use is suggested for evaluation and treatment orientation."},
